{
  "vibecad": "0.1",
  "name": "Stage 1 Carriage",
  "material": "6061 aluminum",
  "process": "CNC or waterjet aluminum plate",
  "design_notes": "Stage1 carriage (10mm 6061). Rides the base's MGN9 rails on two MGN9C blocks (M3 counterbored from the front, cbore 6mm so heads clear the stage2 rails and sit flush under the stage2 blocks). Front face: stage2 MGN9 rails (M3 tapped, depth 7). +Y: drive-belt jaw clamping the inner strand of the motor loop (1:1 with motor). -Y edge: two M5 tapped holes for the cascade idlers (axis Y, centred in the plate thickness at casc_x), casc_pz_top - casc_pz_bot = 166mm apart, which keeps both cascade clamps between the idlers over the full stroke. Posed at s1 (shared with all lift/ files). Shared dims: see lift/base_plate design_notes.",
